WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:07,480
Li Jian

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,580
I heard you were promoted to deputy minister

3
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:10,500
Okay bro

4
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:11,940
You didn't tell me such a big happy event

5
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,060
Go buy me a cup of coffee

6
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:15,140
OK, let's go, I invite you

7
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,950
When did you become so stingy?

8
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:19,430
Just treat me to bottled coffee

9
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:21,770
Just drink it here and it tastes pretty good

10
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:24,370
I drank from this place yesterday

11
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:26,170
Compare with super coffee

12
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:27,370
It's just horse urine

13
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:32,050
He just doesn't think the taste is right

14
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:33,980
I'm not wrong

15
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,460
If this tastes good

16
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,300
That super coffee is the state religion

17
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:41,590
If you keep talking, I will really love you.
